- Shescape commit [552e8ea](https://github.com/ericcornelissen/shescape/commit/552e8eab56861720b1d4e5474fb65741643358f9)
- Shescape Release [v1.6.1](https://github.com/ericcornelissen/shescape/releases/tag/v1.6.1)

